fects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 10cca22e-bdee-4b1f-bc5d-3ca565820366)) (text "UART8 PE1TX/PE0RX; RUN PC5; MOTOR_OK PB2.\nRUN HIGH only permits an independent lower hardware gate.\nMOTOR_OK HIGH=healthy; LOW/open/unpowered=unsafe.\nU10 protects received UART/OK when host rail is off.\nLower board needs mirrored receivers, RUN pull-down,\nVM/reset/3V3 interlocks and command-age/watchdog timeout." (at 215 262 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5ac95eac-8305-4d76-ab40-2856d23f629e)) (text "Flight targets leaveRUN LOW. Custom gimbal protocol is not supplied\nby compiling Betaflight/Rotorflight/INAV/ArduPilot.\nCRC/sequence/age/arm state and deliberate re-arm mandatory.\nOld motor board stays paused and is not directly compatible." (at 20 246 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 3ebd9267-703d-459f-a6b3-0ab9476e8a86)))
